MODULE: SagaRefusalPreservesProgressCompensatesOnSaturation
TARGET: SagaRefusalPreservesProgress
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: quiesce refusal emits an abort instead of preserving Execute progress
PERTURBS: SagaRefuse

--- FIND
        IF saga.status = "waiting" /\ SagaValue = 2 THEN "refused" ELSE "ready"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: compensate a retryable saturation refusal.
        IF saga.status = "waiting" /\ SagaValue = 2 THEN "refused" ELSE "ready",
        !.aborts = IF saga.status = "waiting" THEN 1 ELSE @]
--- END
